    "# 2026 - 09 -01 \n",
    "## 1 Kolmogorov–Arnold Representation Theorem\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(x_1,\\dots,x_n)\n",
    "=\n",
    "\\sum_{q=0}^{2n}\n",
    "\\Phi_q\n",
    "\\left(\n",
    "\\sum_{p=1}^{n}\n",
    "\\phi_{q,p}(x_p)\n",
    "\\right)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "###     worked Example\n",
    "    xy = exp ( log x + log y ),  x,y > 0 \n",
    "            \n"
